WEBVTT

00:16:25.828 --> 00:16:32.802
(Music)

00:16:35.728 --> 00:16:38.166
AG: OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:40.679
I've played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors

00:16:40.703 --> 00:16:41.871
for this podcast,

00:16:41.895 --> 00:16:44.586
because they all have interesting
cultures of their own.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:47.075
Today we're going inside
the workplace at BetterUp.

00:16:55.475 --> 00:16:58.345
Rachel Barton: When you come
to a completely different field,

00:16:58.369 --> 00:17:02.156
it's really daunting to be a senior leader
who can't talk the lingo.